	(text_box "EMMC\nLFBGA-100 14.0x18.0mm P1.0mm footprint\nOnly HS200 mode is supported by our chip, leave DS pin NC\n\nSABRE is SD4, CMD/CLK/8x but no reset\n- CMD is pulled up 10k, but we do not\n- Pin has a default PU of 100k\n\nREX is SD2:\nCMD/CLK/D8/CD/WP/ACT\n\nPOWER\nEither 3.3 + 1.8, or just 3.3\nWe will do 3.3 for all inputs to simplify\n\nCAPS\nAs per ISSI's datasheet:\nVDDI: 4.7uF and 0.1uF\nVCCQ: 4.7uF and 2.2uF\nVCC: 4.7uF and 2.2uF\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
